 "notes": [
  "sourceClass is null unless the state is the assigned state; a state is NOT a tenth class",
  "canonicalSegmentIdentity is recomputed by the validator; a supplied value is never trusted",
  "free-form fields (humanReadableLocator, physicalHeading, sourceLocators) are audit metadata only",
  "classificationEvidenceMode is always CONTENT: metadata locates, it never classifies (R-FORM, R-EVID)",
  "canonicalSegmentIdentity is null for a segment that was not bound and for a segment whose occurrence correspondence is not established",
  "occurrenceCorrespondence names the frame that established the identity (FRAME-C / FRAME-U) or the marker UNESTABLISHED; CSI-v5 proof names no longer exist",
  "canonicalSegmentIdentity is CSI-v6, recomputed by the validator (checks R-3, C-6); a supplied value is never trusted",
  "an OA-14 witness role and a withheld occurrence are recorded diagnostics of the anchor block, never states",
  "b2CountDisposition is a COUNTING disposition of R-COUNT step 5b, not a state, not a class and not a public sourceClass disposition; segment records are never written by it",
  "the touching-atom relation (TOUCHING_SAME_ATOM, TOUCHING_SAME_ATOM_IN_SOME_MEMBERS, DIFFERENT_ATOMS) is a count-stage diagnostic of R-COUNT step 5b; it never enters a segment record",
  "LOWERCASE_CONTINUATION_AFTER_ATERM is a separator-evidence decision; it never enters a segment record, a count block or an identity",
  "SENTENCE_EVIDENCE_ON_DOCUMENTARY_INTERVAL and ENTITY_INTERNAL_PERIOD_NOT_SENTENCE_EVIDENCE are separator-evidence decisions; they never enter a segment record, a count block or an identity"
 ]
